{"version":1,"content":"<p>【殘酷現實 😭】許多獨立遊戲開發者往往認為，只要作品在 Steam 平台累計銷售額達到數十萬美元，便能實現財務自由。</p><p>然而，有遊戲開發者在 Reddit 訴苦，在 Steam 賣遊戲實際扣除平台抽成、退款及各項稅費後的淨收益，可能遠低於外界想像，利潤少得可憐。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T08:22:54.958506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:58:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T14:57:38.723643+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T08:17:42.947208+00:00","content_hash":"330643cab81ace7a452a278acfc06a92ff0897eed092f65c545aff45b3ad1d80","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}